<h2><a id="Sintaxi" name="Sintaxi"></a>Syntax</h2>

<!-- Aquí inicia la part corresponent a la sintaxi de miramon. Aquesta part s'ha d'editar desde el document WPS (aplicacio.mps).-->
<span id="wpssintaxi"/>
<!-- Aquí acaba la part corresponent a la sintaxi de miramon editable de el WPS.-->
<!--===Nou=====-->
<p>Finally, note that it is NOT possible to use the Simplified and Advanced Syntax at the same time. </p>
<!--===Fi de Nou=====-->

<p>Recommended syntax for map compression/decompression:<br/>
MMZ 3 MMZFile MMMFile /REGENERACIO=ARBRE [/CERTIFICAT]<br/>
MMZ 1 MMZFile Dir</p>

<p>Recommended syntax for compression and labeling for opening DBF files:<br/>
MMZ 2 MMZFile Taula.DBF /REGENERACIO=RELATIVA /RELATIU= [/CERTIFICAT]<br/>
MMZ 5 MMZFile 0 OBERTURA:1</p>

<!-- $$EXCLUSIVA$$

To obtain the complete help, please type:
MMZ ?
-->
